#: globalPlugins/googleTtsForNvda/uiUtils.py:633
msgid ""
"Google TTS For NVDA is free, open-source software, and donations are "
"completely optional.\n"
"\n"
"Contributions go to the maintainer to support ongoing development, "
"compatibility updates, and releases. When sending a transfer, please include "
"the note \"{memo}\" so it is easy to identify.\n"
"\n"
"Choose Open PayPal link to donate through PayPal in your browser. Choose "
"View payment methods to see bank transfer details for Vietnam, the US, and "
"international SWIFT on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Google TTS Para NVDA es software gratuito y de código abierto, y las "
"donaciones son completamente opcionales.\n"
"\n"
